{
 "description": "Settings for tools/dev/upstream-sync/sync.py (the upstream sync dry run). base_commit is the commit in OUR history whose tree equals the upstream release we imported; this repo has no upstream ancestry, so releases are applied as a three-way merge against that tree.",
