 "description_moved_libraries": "Paths that Telegram-iOS ships as vendored source (or, for the official pins, as a copy) and that we replaced by a submodule of a fork or an official pin. When a release changes a file under these prefixes, sync.py names the library and the fork branch to patch, so the upstream fix is not lost by the merge."
